<title>USA: TABLE - McDonald &amp; Co Q1 net falls.</title>
<headline>TABLE - McDonald &amp; Co Q1 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except share and per-share amounts)</p>
<p>						     Three Months Ended</p>
<p>					     Jun 27, 1997  Jun 28, 1996</p>
<p> Revenues					  64,562	  67,332</p>
<p> Income before income taxes		   8,921	  10,058</p>
<p> Provision for income taxes		   3,300	   3,600</p>
<p> Net income					 5,621	   6,458</p>
<p> Net income per share			    0.61	    0.71</p>
<p>Average number of shares</p>
<p>and share equivalents</p>
<p>   outstanding				9,188,000     9,135,000</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said investment banking revenues dropped in the current quarter as revenues from principal transactions rose.</p>
<p>Full name is McDonald &amp; Co Investments Inc.</p>
</text>
